  "title": "Fine Crisp Cakes",
  "description": "This tasty and delicious Elizabethan era crisp cakes recipe is made with sugar, butter, and eggs, and uses seasonings such as allspice and turmeric.",
  "authors": [
    "Jenna Arden"
  ],
